[{"sha": "3d89af918ecec9b63f99af92683ee6c477064bd2", "node_id": "C_kwDOD0AxsdoAKDNkODlhZjkxOGVjZWM5YjYzZjk5YWY5MjY4M2VlNmM0NzcwNjRiZDI", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Jiayi Cai", "email": "jyc12888@gmail.com", "date": "2026-10-01T21:04:22Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-10-01T21:04:22Z"}, "message": "Support entity_namespace in user commands entity creation (#3871)\n\n\nThis PR adds new services for creating entities with a namespace:\n  - `/world/<world>/create_with_ns`\n  - `/world/<world>/create_with_ns_multiple`\n\nThe new services use `EntityFactoryWithNs` messages. When a namespace is provided, it is applied to the created model. When no namespace is provided, the model keeps the namespace from the SDF if one exists.\n\nThis also updates entity cloning so cloned entities can either:\n  - use a namespace passed by the caller\n  - keep the original entity namespace when no new namespace is passed\n\nTests were updated to cover entity creation with and without namespaces, namespace overrides, and namespace handling during cloning.\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <1409947012@qq.com>\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <jyc12888@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>", "tree": {"sha": "981f3e57c279d65c8fb31cbe3479cdd22e34df2d", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/trees/981f3e57c279d65c8fb31cbe3479cdd22e34df2d"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/commits/3d89af918ecec9b63f99af92683ee6c477064bd2", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvsrWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmTEQAIeel4RO6KTdoSu2Bevl7K7K\nX77YXS4T/HTNBEfmcPPDJVoxKm2iVvAsfKXkpF9+VCaxtXYVN+LiWcAbR9yfAxoe\n4NTYYAqMHfA/kQ4yRM2xTKP1c1/JWyQ6NK6f6dr21Gq4TKHnJclO9bledV1Ruawt\nXA4yeU1nWkzls2LG/LJpy1vRQcRfBU+uQjThC3seUbp0ARpYpOW0gZ7rksVW/Vi9\nnPVb3UVHaudPcMLOWvyp3XpKXDH6ISHhrcw0iDd8RdWJFE62NM/uMgYybTOJEVy3\ny2MX3287If0Lmtnbx+KU/surcm+BlN3O+LMMcIrp09J2qN4UPEWAgUW7vYDdSINa\npVzSQqdBS9A63JqTrQuzCA0ruVBF1K2SW6ixQdzRZycMsblFLinob8w+erKtkO2c\n1TScWvYUGxl3C8a4ap8awdcbcQ12yPmfW+jNpZnLbM4Tn4vybmZF3zCaY6wrGKbh\nVuuDt1h0Z9bdj2keNCFALkjRqrTvqdL4HwAkt2i70mmmzDUxFPKAWv3hlEUec3Yg\nw6xGeLFcCZAhut3i0LiRKoop9t5UVjxoE89k0BApRPlMqwW1HTdU5yNzZEdzbVeF\n5b1cOzjD6Kv9AVqMJlvzpniMYzK9LbRHhZxbkA543bZZ4/sk87676Dh4p7PVOZKb\ncHDTkjlo6JOuah4Qyb03\n=4xDN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 981f3e57c279d65c8fb31cbe3479cdd22e34df2d\nparent 73a5ea81e4c87e083edfba30fd68f72b07217268\nauthor Jiayi Cai <jyc12888@gmail.com> 1790888662 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790888662 -0500\n\nSupport entity_namespace in user commands entity creation (#3871)\n\n\nThis PR adds new services for creating entities with a namespace:\n  - `/world/<world>/create_with_ns`\n  - `/world/<world>/create_with_ns_multiple`\n\nThe new services use `EntityFactoryWithNs` messages. When a namespace is provided, it is applied to the created model. When no namespace is provided, the model keeps the namespace from the SDF if one exists.\n\nThis also updates entity cloning so cloned entities can either:\n  - use a namespace passed by the caller\n  - keep the original entity namespace when no new namespace is passed\n\nTests were updated to cover entity creation with and without namespaces, namespace overrides, and namespace handling during cloning.\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <1409947012@qq.com>\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <jyc12888@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>", "verified_at": "2026-10-01T21:04:23Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/3d89af918ecec9b63f99af92683ee6c477064bd2", "html_url": "https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/3d89af918ecec9b63f99af92683ee6c477064bd2", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/3d89af918ecec9b63f99af92683ee6c477064bd2/comments", "author": {"login": "C88-YQ", "id": 126311933, "node_id": "U_kgDOB4dd_Q", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126311933?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ", "html_url": "https://github.com/C88-YQ", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "73a5ea81e4c87e083edfba30fd68f72b07217268", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/73a5ea81e4c87e083edfba30fd68f72b07217268", "html_url": "https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/73a5ea81e4c87e083edfba30fd68f72b07217268"}]}, {"sha": "73a5ea81e4c87e083edfba30fd68f72b07217268", "node_id": "C_kwDOD0AxsdoAKDczYTVlYTgxZTRjODdlMDgzZWRmYmEzMGZkNjhmNzJiMDcyMTcyNjg", "commit": {"author": {"name": "pzhu", "email": "q1091803103@gmail.com", "date": "2026-06-23T07:57:18Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Addisu Z. Taddese", "email": "addisuzt@intrinsic.ai", "date": "2026-09-30T22:42:19Z"}, "message": "Make the mechanism that checks wayland and forces to use X for rendering also consider WAYLAND_DISPLAY, WAYLAND_DISPLAY=wayland-0 with empty XDG_SESSION_TYPE is a common scenario for WSLg (#3665)\n\nThis is the same class of issue tracked in [gazebosim/gz-sim#1934](https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/issues/1934) and documented in the [Gazebo troubleshooting guide](https://gazebosim.org/docs/latest/troubleshooting/#wayland-issues).\n\nTool already had a Wayland workaround (added in [PR #2526](https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/pull/2526)): when Qt runs on Wayland, Ogre cannot create a GLX window sharing the \"current\" GL context, so the GUI forces Qt onto the X11 backend (xcb).\n\nHowever, the solution does not cover WSLg. It only checked `XDG_SESSION_TYPE == \"wayland\"`. On WSLg, the environment looks like this:\n<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/strict.dtd\">\n<html>\n<body>\n\nVariable | Typical WSLg value\n-- | --\nWAYLAND_DISPLAY | wayland-0\nXDG_SESSION_TYPE | (empty)\nDISPLAY | :0\n</body>\n</html>\n\nWSLg exposes Wayland via WAYLAND_DISPLAY but does not set XDG_SESSION_TYPE. Qt therefore picks the Wayland platform plugin, Ogre requests a shared GLX context that was never made current, and you get the repeated currentGLContext was specified with no current GL context errors followed by a segfault.\n\nSigned-off-by: pzhu <q1091803103@gmail.com>\n(cherry picked from commit cab867e098bc7f8e55584fe8b30dd66770349b7a)", "tree": {"sha": "c3b16c930f7e9eb3ad022b44b49aa18f9cb93a50", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/trees/c3b16c930f7e9eb3ad022b44b49aa18f9cb93a50"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/commits/73a5ea81e4c87e083edfba30fd68f72b07217268", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/73a5ea81e4c87e083edfba30fd68f72b07217268", "html_url": "https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/73a5ea81e4c87e083edfba30fd68f72b07217268", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/73a5ea81e4c87e083edfba30fd68f72b07217268/comments", "author": {"login": "Pengkun-ZHU", "id": 56779575, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU2Nzc5NTc1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56779575?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU", "html_url": "https://github.com/Pengkun-ZHU", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Pengkun-ZHU/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "azeey", "id": 206116, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjExNg==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206116?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey", "html_url": "https://github.com/azeey", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/azeey/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "49f5ae0a385a7d1a7931bf716920eeff4c6f0f83", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/49f5ae0a385a7d1a7931bf716920eeff4c6f0f83", "html_url": "https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/49f5ae0a385a7d1a7931bf716920eeff4c6f0f83"}]}, {"sha": "49f5ae0a385a7d1a7931bf716920eeff4c6f0f83", "node_id": "C_kwDOD0AxsdoAKDQ5ZjVhZTBhMzg1YTdkMWE3OTMxYmY3MTY5MjBlZWZmNGM2ZjBmODM", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Jiayi Cai", "email": "jyc12888@gmail.com", "date": "2026-09-30T20:33:01Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-09-30T20:33:01Z"}, "message": "Add namespace support to DiffDrive (#3878)\n\n**Changes include:**\n  - Update DiffDrive to resolve `cmd_vel`, `enable`, `odometry`, and `tf` topics using the model namespace when available.\n\n**Expected behavior:**\n  - If a model has a namespace, DiffDrive uses the namespace as the topic prefix instead of `/model/{model_name}`.\n  - Relative custom topics such as `cmd_vel` are resolved under the namespace.\n  - Absolute custom topics such as `/cmd_vel` are kept unchanged.\n  - Existing behavior without a namespace falls back to the model-scoped default topics.\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <1409947012@qq.com>\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <jyc12888@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Jiayi Cai <126311933+C88-YQ@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>", "tree": {"sha": "2142a8df622e2eebbb81eb468ed33399727bd419", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/trees/2142a8df622e2eebbb81eb468ed33399727bd419"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/commits/49f5ae0a385a7d1a7931bf716920eeff4c6f0f83", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvXH9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAErIQABRyahFuLHKu0VRjqQmOLsRC\n5953a34TU++IWWlIZMpV2hSFjmKsonot37cGkVe16ZdCk9o6XGHH8EdTUcX2gqJ/\nIAbV0XKkgqJMWViBNl+zNcCmFp8AylQAve1INZYbbSrHBvY0cbiApBdLKBmM14Kj\nEiPLr2qvt0v87Sb9PmRQBMfYAzGO2sAO0T4LcCfYM5vsxUs5lZNv3M5EEjmb4Bbs\nxA4nTH1lL4c+Cgd9T5gDS9g+UioxzllFHvGaHu9VX8a6o/tAq3UtsrSErNlyoAWn\nhgD11Tz7VAqpu9N6t0OexVWEme7PwcFofW6mVJWoesS/XxM8S6NCFOcgR4mqBVMW\n5SxATK+yBjne1FFkODBrZ0Xwwb3WDDmeInlrOpP4YyIBaQI20YVszJ3NmbfVFUUu\nDuLKfubr8RGEjfYuPxcEs1duxPrndQmGBGLa6if37XPX7Modph3chy7XoSalk+Tr\n4OZFFesC/DsFU/n/T+GJN4eruQsa5DNKvuuLKeYUNt7BNa/T4nujb8PF2RIYln7c\nOCo9Qp7vfpqK9Z+N57EUpkXDl0Qi6Z09bqYuXurJhpr0cwOKdtKXRTIqBukGfFDQ\ntVYpxCKYkGDYf6Wy4SG4D1S49fkAg/+XrocYigO1NU0UzVzrqfSHfleCcSIxufNn\nH9VDka8+bAeGVhfeJC5y\n=L9I4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 2142a8df622e2eebbb81eb468ed33399727bd419\nparent 4c0354d9c2d15a17d859ce2b9ab54e65bfef1321\nauthor Jiayi Cai <jyc12888@gmail.com> 1790800381 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790800381 -0500\n\nAdd namespace support to DiffDrive (#3878)\n\n**Changes include:**\n  - Update DiffDrive to resolve `cmd_vel`, `enable`, `odometry`, and `tf` topics using the model namespace when available.\n\n**Expected behavior:**\n  - If a model has a namespace, DiffDrive uses the namespace as the topic prefix instead of `/model/{model_name}`.\n  - Relative custom topics such as `cmd_vel` are resolved under the namespace.\n  - Absolute custom topics such as `/cmd_vel` are kept unchanged.\n  - Existing behavior without a namespace falls back to the model-scoped default topics.\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <1409947012@qq.com>\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <jyc12888@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Jiayi Cai <126311933+C88-YQ@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>", "verified_at": "2026-09-30T20:33:02Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/49f5ae0a385a7d1a7931bf716920eeff4c6f0f83", "html_url": "https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/49f5ae0a385a7d1a7931bf716920eeff4c6f0f83", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/49f5ae0a385a7d1a7931bf716920eeff4c6f0f83/comments", "author": {"login": "C88-YQ", "id": 126311933, "node_id": "U_kgDOB4dd_Q", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126311933?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ", "html_url": "https://github.com/C88-YQ", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", 