w/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "be07aede783fd585b12ff720c91b0cfc0ff7b535", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/be07aede783fd585b12ff720c91b0cfc0ff7b535", "html_url": "https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/be07aede783fd585b12ff720c91b0cfc0ff7b535"}]}, {"sha": "be07aede783fd585b12ff720c91b0cfc0ff7b535", "node_id": "C_kwDOD0AxsdoAKGJlMDdhZWRlNzgzZmQ1ODViMTJmZjcyMGM5MWIwY2ZjMGZmN2I1MzU", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Jiayi Cai", "email": "126311933+C88-YQ@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2026-09-29T21:17:33Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-09-29T21:17:33Z"}, "message": "Decouple linear and angular limits in MecanumDrive (#3344)\n\nThis PR decouples the linear and angular speed limiter parameters in the MecanumDrive plugin. It follows the same design pattern implemented for DiffDrive in #1229.\n\n## Changes\n\n1. Introduced independent SDF tags for linear and angular limits (velocity, acceleration, and jerk), such as <min_linear_velocity> and <min_angular_velocity>.\n2. Backward Compatibility: Maintained existing generic tags (like <max_velocity>) as fallbacks to ensure no breakage for existing models.\n3. Consistency: Aligned MecanumDrive parameter handling with DiffDrive as established in #1229.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <1409947012@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisu@openrobotics.org>\nCo-authored-by: Steve Peters <scpeters@intrinsic.ai>", "tree": {"sha": "51f8dd10995c9624df0a7c6b10765f8279111abc", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/trees/51f8dd10995c9624df0a7c6b10765f8279111abc"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/commits/be07aede783fd585b12ff720c91b0cfc0ff7b535", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvCrtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARZAQAJRdYbPDeXiClOKsTRNyftGQ\nRPKEJYpwFCJBqz345CT0NJ5HPQVDMpsGmc4aAxzqVMh1FT/O8XKLe8sZq8k+BACC\nOhtanAHjjKlRlZOHv67aJM38yDaz4bnDk43VE/jGF8j0+hReZSXYqyIbmBHMUtAj\n1+Vcy3dSe75EisHowdn1vjjI0gVQ/skM/YkcJQ7FnrJ1PMQuxkcaBDBeXFwbu7fQ\nl1hLQedxTZzMayYMX9MzkybJ0W60GGgIqM74hUekryPpaqtd4o9srt5ZLuwJzUCY\nT3jDjKTNAHIH+shbU8iK4gpPLgQ1vxB1bdlco/vQQIR01nZIupjRWTtJAdxUs3ED\ne4nEJQdllRYXZ4SwUw+w2w1bgskNycZ8f2UEI/HJ+d0RGRHUUGexbstXM9VUnfa/\nxoP1OnjMnQly8uVAbzRYt3+jg1IpyEobW/V7GnIB+CwnPpFfnU8dBPx5WkTDEpSz\nrJhG3g5PG+aNc5vfg0a42Xz/cKMOvKbS3ofDGHnTmYih+M1ly50wUFR6pE5Y4Dey\ny19jb8qFhh+u+qlmU2frxMgorF6l4t1ynMjGOf+MJd/rxUw2r1FaiWP2ako4NlD+\nvU4cHwclCiaould7US9TbL6kQGUG9oKOCAkJcYWW/1qJcDuKOBNL3o0bqkOxcOSz\nhnzzM4QrmjdGbYJ6/DQD\n=vAE3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 51f8dd10995c9624df0a7c6b10765f8279111abc\nparent 5f8b90f1fc7d3c7a228fcd41e5137835ffadadbe\nauthor Jiayi Cai <126311933+C88-YQ@users.noreply.github.com> 1790716653 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790716653 -0500\n\nDecouple linear and angular limits in MecanumDrive (#3344)\n\nThis PR decouples the linear and angular speed limiter parameters in the MecanumDrive plugin. It follows the same design pattern implemented for DiffDrive in #1229.\n\n## Changes\n\n1. Introduced independent SDF tags for linear and angular limits (velocity, acceleration, and jerk), such as <min_linear_velocity> and <min_angular_velocity>.\n2. Backward Compatibility: Maintained existing generic tags (like <max_velocity>) as fallbacks to ensure no breakage for existing models.\n3. Consistency: Aligned MecanumDrive parameter handling with DiffDrive as established in #1229.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <1409947012@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisu@openrobotics.org>\nCo-authored-by: Steve Peters <scpeters@intrinsic.ai>", "verified_at": "2026-09-29T21:17:34Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/be07aede783fd585b12ff720c91b0cfc0ff7b535", "html_url": "https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/be07aede783fd585b12ff720c91b0cfc0ff7b535", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/be07aede783fd585b12ff720c91b0cfc0ff7b535/comments", "author": {"login": "C88-YQ", "id": 126311933, "node_id": "U_kgDOB4dd_Q", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126311933?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ", "html_url": "https://github.com/C88-YQ", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "5f8b90f1fc7d3c7a228fcd41e5137835ffadadbe", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/5f8b90f1fc7d3c7a228fcd41e5137835ffadadbe", "html_url": "https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/5f8b90f1fc7d3c7a228fcd41e5137835ffadadbe"}]}, {"sha": "5f8b90f1fc7d3c7a228fcd41e5137835ffadadbe", "node_id": "C_kwDOD0AxsdoAKDVmOGI5MGYxZmM3ZDNjN2EyMjhmY2Q0MWU1MTM3ODM1ZmZhZGFkYmU", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Jiayi Cai", "email": "126311933+C88-YQ@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2026-09-29T19:47:51Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-09-29T19:47:51Z"}, "message": "Add helper functions for namespaced topic resolution and unit test setup (#3897)\n\nThis PR mainly adds helper functions for topic namespace support and for related tests.\n\n- `resolvedTopicName`\n  - Resolves topic names from SDF plugin elements.\n  - Uses a non-empty custom topic from SDF when available.\n  - Prefixes relative custom topics with the provided namespace.\n  - Leaves absolute custom topics unchanged.\n  - Falls back to the default topic when the SDF element is missing or empty.\n  - Adds tests coverage for relative, absolute, empty, and missing topic elements.\n\n- `UnitTestUtil`\n  - Adds reusable helpers for setting up unit test contexts.\n  - Supports loading a world from an SDF string and creating its entity.\n  - Supports loading a model from an SDF string and creating its entity.\n  - Optionally extracts the first plugin SDF for test use.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <1409947012@qq.com>\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <jyc12888@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>", "tree": {"sha": "4ad07146f52831896a816ef935832b68f8555d0c", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/trees/4ad07146f52831896a816ef935832b68f8555d0c"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/commits/5f8b90f1fc7d3c7a228fcd41e5137835ffadadbe", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvBXnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxt4QAIP9gWrSo+csZLRzboKHHGDV\nuYw1atyb4mPV8JDvTJHLbekmTPIaZx8Wgqs9hMbXi1fOFrgosvv1WgIu/Dj9Khr3\n8Ua6/jkvwMwyu60dA6yNlszWm4+81rbDKOAnxFvJbk9ADzDbZPRvu6JwxBWkyZYr\nLhjSdQWUFgpr9mficzqE62z0djwXiP0UB3m8f1vSwoUsXr68JbXa/68ZlNm3qXHy\nmoyL7FHpd/wUYZAjN8SiQuhFica0Ii73OMZ76fywpV/xbTkVOquuhreLkCc25hnR\nkvCn6gaMEwScE+1cQFfojWl2nj6D/9EXsdm3ytlZKwI2N8K/mpEH9tIK+SQiRKfn\n1a03GUIWGOS04YNSCiKGgxCLazo3crac77LHDUtl4dwhGLK2bMtySkVFEXjHE6yG\nUuqd5PqvTbiKxju7/3jVBTra1kg0Kuo8/eN+St0xq9a8xYJau/snxO7hfNm25yOV\nbsW5Y/wDWHfPg0D31xgrNyZOejYb5hPNEV68A87UNO3JlBBYGYTcvJm8vBkBp+tX\nb5v3JM6nzw+33grUAhHABaE53ckz9oM7mstHSssTzDJ5yCnbcBcZkCWB6wvla0gJ\nQ1c/cOFmj0pYEsoVHOOcDxFXPVH60M6Me6ldDN96bsADmX7RLNRkeL8lz6ICZqYV\nZTKgFDu0t5H3GQmhn0U2\n=3ePR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 4ad07146f52831896a816ef935832b68f8555d0c\nparent 08b3b701141327e250b0026387be95db183bde4f\nauthor Jiayi Cai <126311933+C88-YQ@users.noreply.github.com> 1790711271 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790711271 -0700\n\nAdd helper functions for namespaced topic resolution and unit test setup (#3897)\n\nThis PR mainly adds helper functions for topic namespace support and for related tests.\n\n- `resolvedTopicName`\n  - Resolves topic names from SDF plugin elements.\n  - Uses a non-empty custom topic from SDF when available.\n  - Prefixes relative custom topics with the provided namespace.\n  - Leaves absolute custom topics unchanged.\n  - Falls back to the default topic when the SDF element is missing or empty.\n  - Adds tests coverage for relative, absolute, empty, and missing topic elements.\n\n- `UnitTestUtil`\n  - Adds reusable helpers for setting up unit test contexts.\n  - Supports loading a world from an SDF string and creating its entity.\n  - Supports loading a model from an SDF string and creating its entity.\n  - Optionally extracts the first plugin SDF for test use.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <1409947012@qq.com>\nSigned-off-by: C88-YQ <jyc12888@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>", "verified_at": "2026-09-29T19:47:52Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/5f8b90f1fc7d3c7a228fcd41e5137835ffadadbe", "html_url": "https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/5f8b90f1fc7d3c7a228fcd41e5137835ffadadbe", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/5f8b90f1fc7d3c7a228fcd41e5137835ffadadbe/comments", "author": {"login": "C88-YQ", "id": 126311933, "node_id": "U_kgDOB4dd_Q", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126311933?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ", "html_url": "https://github.com/C88-YQ", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/C88-YQ/orgs", "repos_url": "